          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 NW                  PITSTONE             CHEDDINGTON ROAD 4/142                                          Orchard Farmhouse - -                                              II House.  C17 wing to rear, extended to south early - mid C19.  Rear wing has timber frame with whitewashed brick infill and old tile roof.  2 storeys, 3 bays.  C20 leaded 2 and 3-light casements.  Flanking doors, that to right in small gabled projection.  Lean-to to left.  Taller C19 bay to right is of whitewashed brick and has barred horizontal sliding sashes with cambered heads.  Gable of front wing, set back to far right, has similar sashes and lean-to porch.  Front wing is of whitewashed brick with old tile roof and flanking brick chimneys.  2 storeys, 3 bays.  3-pane sashes with cambered heads and louvred shutters.  Ground floor of centre bay  has barred wooden window with semi-circular fanlight, probably replacing door.  Lean-to C20 conservatory to right. Listing NGR: SP9323716053"
    }
  ],
